  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "Allow contacts to write directly to shader properties.\n\nIf enabled on a receiver, you select up to four target MeshRenderer components that will then have the full world-space transform matrix of each of the receiver’s four nearest contacting senders written to their material properties, in addition to the transform of the receiver component itself.\n\nLearn more in our [Aug 27 Developer Update](https://ask.vrchat.com/t/developer-update-27-august-2026/48877#p-90617-material-contacts-6).",
